      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Super_Hospital,_Birmingham_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1751028.jpg",
      "width": 640,
      "height": 480,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0",
      "artist": "Chris Allen",
      "description": "Super Hospital, Birmingham This is the new hospital on the Queen Elizabeth site and apparently the first users start to move in during June 2010 (must say it looks very nearly finished now). The ordnance survey map now bears little resemblance to this area as all the pre-existing buildings and car parks have gone and this has appeared. I understand cellular pathology is moving from the medical school to this building in the next 18 months and I'm looking forward to begging a look.",
